{"part": {"video_part_id": 666, "bvid": "BV1W44y1U7Ge", "page_index": 0, "cid": 920764402, "title": "【作词翻唱】花影", "duration_ms": 283000, "processing_status": "metadata_collected", "created_at": 1792025947, "updated_at": 1792025947}, "transcript": {"transcript_id": 1333, "video_part_id": 666, "source_kind": "asr-local", "language": "Chinese", "model_id": 1, "version": 1, "content_sha256": "6b51280a3e937ef3d76aa42c23700929eee3b0a9f0323733818382e3180d50be", "created_at": 1792060064}, "segments": [{"ordinal": 0, "start_ms": 80, "end_ms": 4960, "text": "啊，再强调一遍，我唱的所有爱情歌曲，它的实质都是革命歌曲啊。"}, {"ordinal": 1, "start_ms": 5360, "end_ms": 6560, "text": "你们可以，我我"}, {"ordinal": 2, "start_ms": 8080, "end_ms": 11520, "text": "还有一首，也是一七八年写的啊，"}, {"ordinal": 3, "start_ms": 12560, "end_ms": 13600, "text": "可能是一六年写的。"}, {"ordinal": 4, "start_ms": 26240, "end_ms": 53200, "text": "人生似飞花转无影，问落英谁人信？"}, {"ordinal": 5, "start_ms": 54000, "end_ms": 61440, "text": "春风中成影不语，明月照飞花成梦影。"}, {"ordinal": 6, "start_ms": 62480, "end_ms": 68640, "text": "如你容颜多情，笑我无处觅游行。"}, {"ordinal": 7, "start_ms": 68640, "end_ms": 98400, "text": "茫然群群无边，沉醉秋色云烟。"}, {"ordinal": 8, "start_ms": 98880, "end_ms": 103920, "text": "凌波横塘旧路，剩残阳晚晴。"}, {"ordinal": 9, "start_ms": 104480, "end_ms": 109440, "text": "几度春风拂面，宛若多情人间。"}, {"ordinal": 10, "start_ms": 110160, "end_ms": 115120, "text": "耳畔凄凄低语，诉与谁听？"}, {"ordinal": 11, "start_ms": 126880, "end_ms": 132000, "text": "时光穿梭无尽，草木清晰相依。"}, {"ordinal": 12, "start_ms": 132720, "end_ms": 137680, "text": "黄昏中花似无骨，明柔似水。"}, {"ordinal": 13, "start_ms": 138480, "end_ms": 143200, "text": "与君别离至今，与君相约至今。"}, {"ordinal": 14, "start_ms": 144000, "end_ms": 151600, "text": "柳梢上明月秋雨等影影惜曾经。"}, {"ordinal": 15, "start_ms": 152320, "end_ms": 157360, "text": "残花旧人曾逝去，苍庄下谁来起？"}, {"ordinal": 16, "start_ms": 157440, "end_ms": 162000, "text": "无奈往事在梦里。"}, {"ordinal": 17, "start_ms": 163360, "end_ms": 174160, "text": "待明日飞花传风里，碎泪滴落风里，恰似你说的诗意。"}, {"ordinal": 18, "start_ms": 200863, "end_ms": 205503, "text": "五斗缤纷中，何物在闪耀？"}, {"ordinal": 19, "start_ms": 205903, "end_ms": 209263, "text": "在孤单风中，独自迎接"}, {"ordinal": 20, "start_ms": 210703, "end_ms": 212463, "text": "未来，在明月"}, {"ordinal": 21, "start_ms": 214143, "end_ms": 225263, "text": "圆满中盛开，将那遥远遥远光明带来到人间。"}, {"ordinal": 22, "start_ms": 227103, "end_ms": 237343, "text": "多少落花了无痕，有多少痴心人执着飘零在红尘。"}, {"ordinal": 23, "start_ms": 238063, "end_ms": 240543, "text": "而如今忽略了纷争，"}, {"ordinal": 24, "start_ms": 241583, "end_ms": 247743, "text": "只留下这份真，你我身影重合的时分。"}]}